This buildenv-gcccuda module makes available:
 - Compilers:
   + GCC 14.3: gcc, g++ and gfortran
 - CUDA SDK 13.0
 - CUDA capable MPI (GPU aware) library with mpi-wrapped compilers:
   + MPICH v. 4.3.2 with mpicc, mpifort, etc.
 - NCCL 2.29.7 (with ofi net plugin)
 - NVSHMEM 3.4.5
 - Numerical CPU libraries optimised for the Grace CPU:
   + OpenBLAS 0.3.32 with BLAS, LAPACK
   + ScaLAPACK 2.2.2
   + FFTW 3.3.11
 - Numerical GPU libraries optimised for the Hopper GPU:
   + cuFFTMp 12.1.3
   + CUDA SDK math libraries

Access to the libraries are contained within the standard
environment variables CPATH (headers) and LIBRARY_PATH (libs)
which are picked up by default by the compilers. In addition
relevant variables for `cmake` and `pkg-config` are also set.

